@startuml uc_admin_04_audit

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam actorStyle awesome

title <size:18><b>Domain 4 — Audit</b></size>\nUse Case Detail

left to right direction

actor "Owner" as Owner #E8F5E9
actor "Super Admin" as SuperAdmin #E3F2FD

rectangle "Administration System" {

  package "Audit Trail" as AuditPkg #F3E5F5 {
    usecase "UC-4.1\nView Audit\nLog" as UC41
  }
}

database "CloudSQL\nAudit Records" as CloudSQL #F3E5F5

' === Actor connections ===
Owner --> UC41
SuperAdmin --> UC41

' === System connections ===
UC41 ..> CloudSQL : <<include>>\nRead-only query

' === Notes ===
note bottom of UC41
  **Access restricted to:**
  Owner and Super Admin only.
  Channel Managers and Analysts
  are excluded.
  -----
  **Properties:**
  - Append-only from app perspective
  - Cannot be edited or deleted
  - Retained indefinitely (V1)
end note

note right of UC41
  **Recorded fields:**
  - Actor + role at time of action
  - Timestamp
  - Action
  - Target entity type + ID
  - Outcome
  - Before/after state
  - Error info
  - Import ID (bulk ops)
end note

note bottom of CloudSQL
  **Audit records are immutable:**
  BR-016: Cannot be edited or
  deleted through the application.
  BR-017: Retained indefinitely.
  NFR-002: Every mutation is
  traceable to an authenticated
  administrator.
end note

@enduml
